{"3017130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bashful Adoration", "steam_appid": 3017130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Our Discord!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017130/extras/39637a7f67c5ad2c9917c6bcb31a6b8f.poster.avif?t=1780883490\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017130/extras/39637a7f67c5ad2c9917c6bcb31a6b8f.webm?t=1780883490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017130/extras/39637a7f67c5ad2c9917c6bcb31a6b8f.mp4?t=1780883490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017130/extras/d7bbe1380d8717d984c291f033bad024.avif?t=1780883490\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017130/extras_big/d7bbe1380d8717d984c291f033bad024.avif?t=1780883490 width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017130/extras/ee5b741b96208936d63edb2778398559.poster.avif?t=1780883490\" width=884 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017130/extras/ee5b741b96208936d63edb2778398559.webm?t=1780883490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017130/extras/ee5b741b96208936d63edb2778398559.mp4?t=1780883490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a Witch-filled 3D Platforming adventure! Harness the power of your broom to fly, skate and <strong>BASH</strong> through dangerous, magical environments (and to gain the adoration of your crush!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017130/extras/cd8ecc37287e6683f9f6b4f990313281.avif?t=1780883490\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017130/extras_big/cd8ecc37287e6683f9f6b4f990313281.avif?t=1780883490 width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Four witches with clashing personalities, all trying to find love within complicated stages of their lives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A fantastical, magic world to discover, set on Sky-Islands, Magic Schools and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A dangerous and diverse cast of enemies to battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Just the right amount of chaotic fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017130/extras/7c27b777231850b2ecba360741f3a501.poster.avif?t=1780883490\" width=884 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017130/extras/7c27b777231850b2ecba360741f3a501.webm?t=1780883490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017130/extras/7c27b777231850b2ecba360741f3a501.mp4?t=1780883490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/301713